WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.960
What are you waiting for?

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:12.303
Dusty,

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:14.305
are you okay?

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:16.766
In the Big Door Prize, 

00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:18.810
we find Dusty with his family

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.687
on the occasion of his 40th birthday.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:21.479
Whoop! Whoop!

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:22.689
A scooter!

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:23.481
Wow!

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.818
He's somebody who thinks that he has
everything he wants.

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:29.070
One day, this machine arrives.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.032
What the hell?

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:35.160
It promises to tell people their life potential.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:40.123
And for Dusty, the machine
opens up a chasm of uncertainty

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:44.127
as he reevaluates whether he might
actually want something more out of life.

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:45.587
Where'd you get it?

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:48.256
No idea. It just appeared like magic.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.591
Is that right?

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:56.347
It's also about an entire town
going through a midlife crisis.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.934
This machine turns everyone's life upside down.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:00.894
I got dancer.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:01.895
Superstar.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:02.687
Male model.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.646
Make it stop.

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:05.106
Some people get excited

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.025
and some people have questions.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:09.402
We’re actually getting a divorce.

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:10.779
The Morpho inspired us.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:11.696
What?

00:01:11.988 --> 00:01:16.367
It's so fun to watch the different ways
people interpret their potential.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:17.660
I got explorer.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:21.164
Which obviously means sexual explorer.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:22.165
Obviously.

00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:26.461
Even in a place where people think 
they know everything about everyone.

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:27.629
Are you flexing?

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:28.922
These are my relaxed arms.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.757
When did you get so jacked dad?

00:01:31.007 --> 00:01:34.594
Everyone has their own secret, everyone
has their own inner struggle.

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:37.597
Do you ever get that feeling that there’s like 
a big, heavy foot on your chest?

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:39.724
I think that's just anxiety.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.643
Mr. Hubbard I get that a lot.

00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:47.774
I think what makes the Big Door Prize original
is this incredible cast of characters.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.902
This is so different
from anything that I've worked on.

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:53.446
I see you out here! Let's go!

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:56.282
Kind of like this fantastical, funny,

00:01:56.991 --> 00:01:59.244
but also, a really heartbreaking show.

00:01:59.244 --> 00:02:00.245
You can let me go now.

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:03.998
It's an exciting time to talk about big ideas,

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:07.418
and this is a fantastic
comedy with a great premise.

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.921
What I hope with people when they watch,

00:02:09.921 --> 00:02:10.004
What I hope with people when they watch,

00:02:10.004 --> 00:02:12.257
is that they see themselves in some of these characters.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.971
It really touches on these universal longings within all of us,

00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:20.098
in a funny and poignant way.

00:02:21.057 --> 00:02:23.184
If you were offered another life potential,

00:02:24.102 --> 00:02:24.853
would you take it?

